{"data":{"product":{"id":"gid://shopify/Product/7537096949857","title":"Gray Leopard Mommy and Me Swimsuits - Ruffle Bikini","handle":"gray-leopard-mommy-and-me-swimsuits","status":"ACTIVE","publishedAt":"2026-04-24T17:05:28Z","onlineStoreUrl":"https://www.dresslikemommy.com/products/gray-leopard-mommy-and-me-swimsuits","descriptionHtml":"<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Smooth stretch swim fabric with a softly lined feel; exact fiber content was not visible from the blocked vendor page.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A coordinated mom-and-daughter swimsuit moment made for beach mornings, pool parties, resort afternoons, and vacation photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> \"Gray Leopard\" pairs a gray leopard ruffle top with classic black swim bottoms for a bold, photo-ready match.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Ruffled spaghetti-strap bikini tops, high-waist bottoms, and a sheer tie-side swim skirt shown on the mother style.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Rinse after swimming, hand wash cold, line dry in the shade, and avoid bleach or rough poolside surfaces.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Girls Child 2 Years to Child 12 Years; Mother S to Mother XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Swimsuit</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Size</th>\n      <th>Age</th>\n      <th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n      <th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Skirt Length (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Pant/Short or - (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2-3</td>\n<td>10-15 kg / 22.0-33.1 lbs</td>\n<td>80-100 cm / 31.5-39.4 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4-5</td>\n<td>15.5-17.5 kg / 34.2-38.6 lbs</td>\n<td>102-110 cm / 40.2-43.3 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5-6</td>\n<td>17.5-20 kg / 38.6-44.1 lbs</td>\n<td>110-120 cm / 43.3-47.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-8</td>\n<td>19-22.5 kg / 41.9-49.6 lbs</td>\n<td>120-130 cm / 47.2-51.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>8-10</td>\n<td>22.5-31 kg / 49.6-68.3 lbs</td>\n<td>131-145 cm / 51.6-57.1 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 12 Years</td>\n<td>10-12</td>\n<td>31-37.5 kg / 68.3-82.7 lbs</td>\n<td>145-153 cm / 57.1-60.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>86.36-88.9 cm / 34-35 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>92.71-95.25 cm / 36.5-37.5 in</td>\n<td>66-68.58 cm / 26-27 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>91.44-93.98 cm / 36-37 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>97.79-100.33 cm / 38.5-39.5 in</td>\n<td>71.12-73.66 cm / 28-29 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>97.79-101.6 cm / 38.5-40 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>104.14-107.95 cm / 41-42.5 in</td>\n<td>77.47-81.28 cm / 30.5-32 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>105.41-109.22 cm / 41.5-43 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>111.76-115.57 cm / 44-45.5 in</td>\n<td>85.09-88.9 cm / 33.5-35 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The Gray Leopard Mommy and Me Swimsuits bring a playful beach look to matching family style. The gray leopard ruffle top adds movement and personality, while the black bottoms keep the set easy to style for pool days, resort mornings, and sunny family photos.</p>\n\n<p>The girls' and moms' suits coordinate through the same leopard print and ruffled neckline, with adult body measurements supplied for bust, waist, and hip. Choose the chart-backed size for each swimmer and add coverups, sandals, or hats separately as styling pieces.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Leopard ruffle top:</strong> A gray animal print and soft flounce give both suits a coordinated statement look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Black swim bottoms:</strong> Solid bottoms balance the print and keep the set easy to pair with coverups.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mother swim skirt styling:</strong> The adult look includes a sheer tie-side skirt shown over the swim bottom.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Chart-backed sizing:</strong> Girls sizes follow height, weight, and age guidance; mother sizes use bust, waist, and hip ranges.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vacation-ready match:</strong> Made for pool days, beach trips, resort photos, and coordinated summer memories.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the sizes you need and pack a matching leopard swim look that feels ready for beach days, poolside photos, and every sunny family memory.</p>","tags":["Animal Print","Beach","Bikini Swimsuit","Black","Child 10-12yr","Child 2-3yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 5-6yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 8-10yr","Girl Swimsuit","Gray","High Waist Bottom","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1043999310235.html","Leopard","Matching Family Swimwear","Matching Swimwear","Mom Size L","Mom Size M","Mom Size S","Mom Size XL","Mommy and Me","Mother Swimsuit","Pool","Resort","Ruffle","Ruffle Bikini","Spaghetti Strap","Summer","Swim Skirt","Swimsuits","Two-Piece Swimsuit","Vacation"],"seo":{"title":"Gray Leopard Mommy & Me Swimsuits | Dress Like Mommy","description":"Stretch gray leopard mommy-and-me swimsuits for mom + daughter. Girls 2Y-12Y and Mother S-XL with ruffle bikini styling."},"category":{"id":"gid://shopify/TaxonomyCategory/aa-1-20-17","fullName":"Apparel & Accessories > Clothing > Swimwear > Swim Dresses"},"varian